[{"title":"临江仙","author":"马钰","text":"乞觅残馀真活计，无羞无耻无荣。\n舍身岂是喂饥鹰。\n亦非为虎食，不著假身形。\n万种尘劳齐放下，自然神气灵灵。\n心猿意马两停停。\n无缘沉苦海，有分看蓬瀛。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1170,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"临江仙 长安新出家者","author":"马钰","text":"此个陇西明大道，看来俗累难拘。\n报予天水慕清虚。\n彭城归正觉，割爱后来闾。\n更有段公明慧性，悟来巧变痴愚。\n山侗闻得证无馀。\n忻然如大醉，认得本来如。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1171,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"临江仙 和无名先生韵","author":"马钰","text":"玉往来神气住，翁稳跨青骝。\n风谭氏与刘丘。\n心归正觉，个本环洲。\n火相生铅汞结，人已达清幽。\n侗不日上云头。\n风牢把捉，下好吞钩。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1172,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"临江仙 和赵殿试","author":"马钰","text":"访庚辛成造化，常清净童颜。\n哉表里得翛然。\n生真水纼，去复牵还。\n子投贤贤不面，庵辱教来干。\n分修炼在三关。\n人真宿契，悟放心闲。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1173,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"临江仙 继重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"大悟立身蓑笠好，遇投相应回头。\n训予全道号无忧。\n慧眸观玉洞，云步上琼楼。\n赤雁头钻清宴地，白鸥足捧浮沤。\n两般混合最休休。\n要除三界苦，堪把一灵修。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1174,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"临江仙 继重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"八识通知心已定，遍观物物皆阴。\n不如留意则追寻。\n水中闲养火，玉内要生金。\n直待阳纯丹不漏，恁时可称知音。\n超然云步上瑶岑。\n不劳极目望，自见好光临。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1175,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"养家苦","author":"马钰","text":"养家苦，赡他人。\n衣丰食足尚嫌贫。\n运机心，丧了真。\n修行好，作闲人。\n自然忧道不忧贫。\n炼顽心，养至真。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1176,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"养家苦","author":"马钰","text":"养家苦，没程头。\n一朝身死作阴囚。\n见阎王，不自由。\n修行好，有程头。\n三千功满不为囚。\n做神仙，得自由。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1177,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"养家苦","author":"马钰","text":"修行易，断情难。\n始初分解最艰难。\n譬无常，破尽难。\n心开悟，没疑难。\n觉从前事养家难。\n学神仙，有甚难。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1178,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"养家苦","author":"马钰","text":"思微妙，想尘缘。\n两般搜索要精研。\n但知空，向道坚。\n心清净，意通玄。\n自然知道没言传。\n达无为，作大仙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1179,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"养家苦","author":"马钰","text":"养家苦，为妻男。\n是非荣辱饱经谙。\n限临头，事怎甘。\n修行好，子端南。\n神丹灿烂弃行庵。\n宴瑶池，德饱酣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1180,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"养家苦","author":"马钰","text":"养家苦，似蜂虔。\n采花成蜜为谁甜。\n肯堤防，蛛网粘。\n修行好，做风虔。\n舌生津液玉浆甜。\n溉黄芽，无惹粘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1181,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"养家苦","author":"马钰","text":"养家苦，没休期。\n危危险险似围棋。\n被人祈，无祷祈。\n修行好，最稀奇。\n姹婴争把虎龙骑。\n献胎仙，凤与麒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1182,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"养家苦","author":"马钰","text":"养家苦，特贪饕。\n家丰又待望官高。\n遇危难，无计逃。\n修行好，不贪饕。\n埋光隐迹恐名高。\n处无为，生死逃。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1183,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"养家苦","author":"马钰","text":"养家苦，恋尘缘。\n铺谋活计望千年。\n奈凡躯，不久坚。\n修行好，结良缘。\n功成行满不排年。\n做神仙，因志坚。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1184,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"养家苦","author":"马钰","text":"养家苦，喜相违。\n常常思想死生危。\n怕从前，火院围。\n修行好，处无为。\n神珠光彩透帘帏。\n现灵童，相貌威。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1185,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"养家苦","author":"马钰","text":"养家苦，镇常忙。\n忙来忙去到无常。\n作阴囚，住鬼房。\n修行好，不曾忙。\n闲闲闲里守真常。\n得修完，玉洞房。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1186,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"养家苦 赠宁伯功","author":"马钰","text":"养家苦，火坑深。\n万尘埋没不能禁。\n遇风仙，物外寻。\n修行好，炼阳阴。\n净清能见水中金。\n现光辉，罩宝岑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1187,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南柯子","author":"马钰","text":"王与马相见，心交应宿缘。\n太原梁苑已升天。\n记得当初，留语再相传。\n守服须三载，持心更五年。\n诱人归善行功全。\n此个扶风，重礼害风仙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1188,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南柯子","author":"马钰","text":"无使名过实，常教实若虚。\n藏机隐密恰如愚。\n闲问心王，何处用功夫。\n性做长生宝，身为大药炉。\n炼丹须要饮醍醐。\n醉卧琼楼。\n调弄夜明珠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1189,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南柯子","author":"马钰","text":"不羡人先悟，惟愁我未愚。\n蓬头垢面嘴卢都。\n身做行庵，到处得安居。\n不著人情绊，常教我相除。\n逍遥自在个尘无。\n物外山侗，不解会功夫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1190,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南柯子","author":"马钰","text":"梦里游郊野，骷髅告我来。\n哀声声切切声哀。\n自恨从前，酒色气兼财。\n四害于身苦，人心竟不灰。\n致令万劫落轮回。\n悔不当初，学道做仙材。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1191,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南柯子","author":"马钰","text":"但愿三丹结，何愁两鬓皤。\n蓬头垢面啰哩啰。\n十二时中，谨谨养冲和。\n不羡相如志，无心继伏波。\n马风题柱意如何。\n不做神仙，不过灞陵河。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1192,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南柯子","author":"马钰","text":"悟彻梨和枣，宁贪酒与茶。\n我今云水作生涯。\n奉劝依予，早早早离家。\n我得醉醒趣，君当生死趖。\n同予物外炼丹砂。\n九转功成，步步步烟霞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1193,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南柯子","author":"马钰","text":"昨日因何喜，今朝为甚悲。\n喜他向道慕希夷。\n悲则因他，华丽不相宜。\n既欲搜玄妙，须当做乞儿。\n蓬头垢面嘴累垂。\n意静心清，便是上天梯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1194,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南柯子 七夕吟","author":"马钰","text":"天上初流火，人间乍变秋。\n鹊桥银汉瑞云浮。\n织女今宵，何处唤牵牛。\n闺女离闺阁，无愁自起愁。\n焚香乞巧拜无休。\n恁肯灰心，守拙列仙俦。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1195,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南柯子 十二首赠陈三翁","author":"马钰","text":"在俗非为俗，居尘不染尘。\n如莲不著水之因。\n万卉千花，一叶不沾身。\n营养心中性，修完身内神。\n各人了了继何人。\n庞老全家，拔宅许真君。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1196,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南柯子 自诫","author":"马钰","text":"儿女心头尽，田园意上除。\n金银财宝与妻孥。\n物物般般，屏弃恰如无。\n却著人情事，堪嗟性蠢愚。\n不如一拨守清虚。\n无作无为，便是好功夫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1197,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南柯子 赠马怀玉","author":"马钰","text":"意动心须动，心除意亦除。\n无无寂寂寂还无。\n神气和同，子母得安居。\n莫觅曹溪路，何须问尾闾。\n真清真静养真如。\n真乐真闲，真个好功夫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1198,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南柯子 赠众道友","author":"马钰","text":"心地频频扫，尘情细细除。\n莫教坑堑陷毗卢。\n常静常清，方可论元初。\n性烛频挑剔，曹溪任吸呼。\n勿令喘息气声粗。\n昼夜绵绵，端的好功夫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1199,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挂金灯 赠重阳师父侄王周臣","author":"马钰","text":"绝攀缘，心上生光莹。\n朗然变化。\n无穷异景。\n这密妙、教贤省。\n内貌宜，手速整。\n悟后分凡圣。\n亘初灵明，火内正劲。\n锻炼出、清中静。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1200,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挂金索（北曲）","author":"马钰","text":"三更里，明月正把乾坤照。\n吓得邪魔，千里不见了。\n退尽阴兵，不用刀圭妙。\n海底龟蛇，自然相盘绕。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1201,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挂金索（北曲）","author":"马钰","text":"四更里，无事好把真经看。\n句句幽玄，说道教修炼。\n不用水火，不用柴和炭。\n炼就灵丹，万两金不换。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1202,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挂金索（北曲）","author":"马钰","text":"五更里，天晓架上金鸡叫。\n有个忙儿，拍手呵呵笑。\n放饱牛儿，快活睡一觉。\n行满功成，自有丹书诏。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1203,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挂金索（北曲）","author":"马钰","text":"一更里，端坐慢慢调龙虎。\n运转三关，透入泥丸去。\n龙蟠金鼎，虎绕黄庭户。\n这些儿工夫，等闲休分付。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1204,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挂金索（北曲）","author":"马钰","text":"二更里，二点阴阳真气妙。\n上下三关，休教差错了。\n姹女婴儿，两个都放娇。\n金公黄婆，自然匹配了。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1205,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"柳梢青 和古词韵二首 其一","author":"马钰","text":"悟个不生不灭。\n更不肯、拈花摘叶。\n忻则高歌，醉眠芳草。\n攀游仙阙。\n有时普劝人人，莫讶我、丁宁切切。\n走骨行尸，贪财竞色，枉销年月。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1206,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"柳梢青 藏头","author":"马钰","text":"轮不催生灭。\n焰里莲开五叶。\n得金花，成芝草，分无阙。\n生马钰愚人，然悟家缘痛切。\n劈恩山，明千古，谈心月。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1207,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"洞中天 本名鹧鸪天寄呈马运甫","author":"马钰","text":"休赌休饮休保人。\n减些烟焰少婪尘。\n能搜己过为长便，不见他非获好因。\n惊宠辱，乐清贫。\n修心养性惜精神。\n常凭如此成功行，明月清风作友真。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1208,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"洞中天 全真庵丹井","author":"马钰","text":"穿凿须当二九深。\n甘泉自有应清吟。\n更祈治病名丹井，相称山侗普济心。\n人听劝，作知音。\n重阳妙趣好追寻。\n紫芝气焰生形象，碧眼真如上宝岑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1209,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"洞中天 赠员先生","author":"马钰","text":"蓦想浮华痛我心。\n暂时荣显落沉沦。\n争如物外逍遥客，岂似寰中自在人。\n忘俗虑，乐清贫。\n住行坐卧啰哩凌。\n炼烹玉鼎长生药，保养金炉不死真。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1210,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"洞中天 赠昭然子","author":"马钰","text":"劝公休要恋迷津。\n华阳巾换皂罗巾。\n不为汨没尘中客，得做逍遥物外人。\n修道德，固精神。\n虎龙蟠绕啸吟频。\n汞铅自是成丹药，跨鹤腾云礼至真。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1211,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"炼丹砂","author":"马钰","text":"行道要心坚。\n密护丹田。\n调和真息永绵绵。\n十二时中常若见。\n休要尘牵。\n诀要避喧哗，静处安然。\n须通语、默默言传。\n神秀丹成行满。\n得去朝元。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1212,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"炼丹砂","author":"马钰","text":"天水劫云庵。\n远胜精蓝。\n云朋霞友日常参。\n恰似栽松招引鹤，岂是贪婪。\n若肯悟清谈。\n管有香甘。\n田园分付与儿男。\n欲住蓬瀛先改作，落魄婪耽。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1213,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"炼丹砂 赠清静散人孙不二","author":"马钰","text":"奉报富春姑。\n休要随余。\n而今非妇亦非夫。\n各自修完真面目，脱免三涂。\n炼气莫教粗。\n上下宽舒。\n绵绵似有却如无。\n个里灵童调引动，得赴仙都。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1214,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"神光灿 继重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"风仙锁户，马钰辞巢，寂然澹乎自持。\n了干根源，岂肯攀恋妻儿。\n识破气财酒色，凭清净、固养灵芝。\n当下手，暗修完功行，不许人知。\n隐密藏机蓄响，便须常做个玉褐怀披。\n泼杀无明火烛，自是心慈。\n忍辱得何味况，善芽生、仙佛常随。\n通玄妙，这真功，却是无为。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1215,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"神清秀 寄看庞总管园赵公","author":"马钰","text":"些儿微妙非常好。\n猛焰里、自然芝草。\n玉虎与金龙，密护三田宝。\n丹成九转青童报。\n便授取、紫微宣诰。\n体挂六铢衣，跨鹤归蓬岛。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1216,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"贺圣朝","author":"马钰","text":"衣装纸袄并麻布。\n固亘初元素。\n风前月下抚心琴，并无些尘虑。\n□□云朋霞友常相聚。\n看飞乌走兔。\n玉中养就紫金丹，这些儿谁悟。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1217,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"贺圣朝 二首赠王司公","author":"马钰","text":"祥烟瑞气常敷布。\n便觉心归素。\n世人为处我无为，更无思无虑。\n绛房姹女婴儿聚。\n慧目看乌兔。\n斡旋离坎两交宫，这些儿谁悟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1218,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"香山会 次重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"木金交，天地活，真真渐好。\n澄清淇寂深通奥。\n祥光瑞气，把丹砂覆焘。\n方知得、人能弘道。\n仙承妙号。\n定是受、金书诰。\n玄中妙。\n净中来到。\n心通意晓。\n这天机大道。\n当行教，荐赴蓬岛。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1219,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"恣逍遥 继重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"二气绵绵，调来细细。\n向琼壶里头封闭。\n子午宫前，玉金周济。\n这玄妙分明，免教商谜。\n天上灵苗，海中根蒂。\n霞光布灿无涯际。\n忽见真容，如同玉腻。\n通元始修行，在乎子细。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1220,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"恣逍遥 赠韩守玄","author":"马钰","text":"恣意逍遥，逍遥恣意。\n逍遥自在无萦系。\n行坐逍遥，逍遥似醉。\n逍遥到处，似云似水。\n悟彻逍遥，逍遥养气。\n逍遥里面修仙计。\n这个逍遥，逍遥无比。\n逍遥去蓬岛，十洲有位。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1221,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"悟南柯 继重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"立遇心通彻，清香味得餐。\n水中红焰结成团。\n雪里琼花，烂漫不凋残。\n性烛明金阙，神丹晃玉盘。\n齐修六度与三坛。\n出自吾师，内景自然看。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1222,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"悟黄粱 本名燕归梁","author":"马钰","text":"词名本是燕归梁。\n无理趣，忒寻常。\n马风思忆祖纯阳。\n故更易，悟黄粱。\n百年一梦暂时光。\n如省悟，弃家乡。\n常清常净处真常。\n累功行，赴蓬庄。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1223,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"悟黄粱 终南居环堵","author":"马钰","text":"董宣强项岂寻常。\n如燕颔，即非殃。\n掀髯虚长不名疮。\n无破处，又何妨。\n道家贫后计多方。\n无腋袋，用皮囊。\n支颐悬挂度炎凉。\n里面有，万般香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1224,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"悟黄粱 赠兴平杨先生","author":"马钰","text":"密密相传理最深。\n向水里，自生金。\n个人无口解哦吟。\n能云步，曳云襟。\n寻思今古修仙道，今如古，古如今。\n古今难得遇知音。\n知音者，似予心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1225,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"捣练子","author":"马钰","text":"好性子，好性怀。\n不须香火不须斋。\n戴云包，免了灾。\n内修个，不凡胎。\n忘机绝虑屏尘埃。\n产灵童，有大才。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1226,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"捣练子","author":"马钰","text":"灵寿杖，献夫人。\n拨开世网易开尘。\n助行步，出爱津。\n打有著，拄为亲。\n敲昏琢暗求清神。\n挑明月，显至真。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1227,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"捣练子 劝众师兄访道","author":"马钰","text":"马风子，未通玄。\n性昏识昧不翛然。\n倚仗予，枉了贤。\n听予劝，莫推延。\n速当离我便参禅。\n就有道，而正焉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1228,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"捣练子 华州王待诏乞词","author":"马钰","text":"王待诏，善传神。\n日常心意在他人。\n便都忘，自己身。\n如省觉，出迷津。\n逍遥坦荡啰哩凌。\n乐清闲，得悟真。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1229,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"捣练子 离尘","author":"马钰","text":"离尘网，出凡笼。\n髼头垢面类愚蒙。\n眼如盲，耳如聋。\n金为箭，玉为弓。\n木人射透水晶宫。\n赴蓬瀛，玉路通。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1230,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"捣练子 密州李节副求拄杖","author":"马钰","text":"灵寿杖，寄何人。\n陇西节副拨红尘。\n剔开道，离苦津。\n常携执，求为亲。\n擒猿捉马气和神。\n挑圆相，现本真。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1231,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"捣练子 赠三水贾仙","author":"马钰","text":"炎炎火，滚滚汤。\n中间一点忒清凉。\n更玲珑，分外香。\n生祥瑞，吐祥光。\n瑞祥光彩结红霜。\n产胎仙，现玉皇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1232,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"捣练子 赠中条山无为子","author":"马钰","text":"志为剑，慧为刀。\n石娥劈玉见金鳌。\n戏青莲，跃碧涛。\n刀圭饮，胜香醪。\n六三公子著绯袍。\n系云腰。\n万万遭。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1233,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"捣练子 赠云中子苏铉","author":"马钰","text":"云中子，是苏公，听予休要头髼松。\n顶华阳，巾九峰。\n当行化，代山侗。\n云游西北访崆峒。\n阐善缘，立教风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1234,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"捣练子 赠五会道众","author":"马钰","text":"心平等，寿延长。\n修完七宝聚三光。\n悟全真，万事忘。\n玉花绽，金莲芳。\n馨香滋味满斋肠。\n行功成，现玉皇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":1235,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]